<h3>A place full of inspiration</h3>
<p class="p1">Our forest event venue impresses with its versatility: from festive weddings and creative corporate events to lively birthday parties. Here you can bring your visions to life – whether in an intimate circle or with a large party. The expansive grounds and natural elements create an atmosphere your guests will love.</p>

