<h3>Indoors and outdoors – space for every occasion</h3>
<p class="p1">Our generous event grounds span 2,000 m² and include:</p>
<ul>
<li class="p1">An expansive clearing for open-air events.</li>
<li class="p1">A stylish marquee with room for up to 110 guests.</li>
<li class="p1">A cozy fire pit, perfect for conversations and relaxed moments.</li>
<li class="p1">Flexible spaces that can be tailored to the needs of your celebration.</li>
</ul>
<p class="p1">Summer or winter – our venue adapts to your needs.</p>

