<h3>Technical equipment and more</h3>
<p class="p1">We offer state-of-the-art equipment to make your event perfect:</p>
<ul>
<li class="p2"><b>Technology:</b> DJ booth, microphones, speakers, and lighting.</li>
<li class="p2"><b>Furniture:</b> Elegant tables, crossback chairs, and bench seating.</li>
<li class="p2"><b>Extras:</b> Mini golf lanes for fun and entertainment.</li>
</ul>

